{
  "intro": [
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:0",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "并没有什么前兆，那件事情就发生了。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:7",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "当时，街上人山人海。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:8",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "有的在商场里购物，有的在餐馆用餐，有的在公园里打发时间……。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:9",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "一成不变的日常。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:10",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "今天一定也是安稳的一天。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:11",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "任何人都对此深信不疑。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:12",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "没有理由不相信，这样的日子会在今天明天大后天一直持续下去。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:13",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "谁都没有想到，会突然有从“其他存在”从“其他世界”到来，破坏自己的生活。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:14",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "但是，它确实发生了。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:16",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "――非人的存在。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:18",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "简直就像是电影或小说中出现的魔法一般。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:22",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "也没有解决方法。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:23",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "但是，就是有“这样的存在”，这就是这样的一个故事……。",
      "background": "black",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:24",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「哈啊…………哈啊…………哈啊…………」",
      "background": "forest",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:25",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "肩膀大幅度起伏，气喘吁吁地，美亚在深林中走着。",
      "background": "forest",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:26",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「哈啊…………哈啊…………哈啊…………」",
      "background": "forest",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:31",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "从开始逃跑，至今已经移动了多大距离呢。",
      "background": "forest",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:32",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "不知不觉中冲入了森林之中，这个选择究竟正确与否，她并不知道。",
      "background": "forest",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:33",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「为什么……会有这种事……」",
      "background": "forest",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:34",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "虽然在逃跑，但是她还没有对事态做出正确的理解。",
      "background": "forest",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:35",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "说到底，现在，到底发生了什么……。",
      "background": "forest",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s101.txt:start:37",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「不是梦吗？如果不是的话……那种……」",
      "background": "forest",
      "portrait": ""
    }
  ],
  "room": [
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:0",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「……………………」",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:1",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "美亚睁开眼睛的时候，最先看到的是房间的天花板。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:2",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "似乎带有什么图形，但是并不能看得很清楚。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:3",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "是什么花纹吗，短时间内无意义地如此思考着。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:4",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「这里是……」",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:6",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "看上去像是哪个建筑物里的房间，但是美亚对于这个地方完全没有印象。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:9",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "但是，这完全是个陌生的场所。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:10",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "天花板和墙壁的颜色，桌子和床，还有窗帘的花样，都不曾出现在美亚的记忆之中。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:11",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「我……是怎么了？」",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:12",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "慢慢地坐起身来。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:20",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「……………………」",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:21",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "完全不清楚到底发生了什么事。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:22",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "无论多少次环视房间中的摆设，记忆中都没有这样的地方。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:26",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「但是，我……在森林中……」",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:27",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "中断的记忆渐渐苏醒。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:28",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "如果没有记错的话，美亚应该是遇到了一名来路不明的男人。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:30",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「……………………」",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:33",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "既然如此，那为什么现在会睡在这个房间里……。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:35",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "她注意到位于房间角落的衣柜。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:39",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "衣柜里有一件衣服。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": "sad"
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:40",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "只是，那并非普通的洋装，而是以黑色为基调，附有花边和蕾丝，看上去十分贵重的衣服。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": "sad"
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:41",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「……………………」",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": "sad"
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:44",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「……………………」",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": "sad"
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:45",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "很奇妙的感觉。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": "sad"
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:48",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「这里……是宅邸或者公馆，这种地方吗？」",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": "sad"
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:49",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "从窗户向外看，可以看到一个广阔的庭院",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": "sad"
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:50",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "挺远的周围被森林包围着，隐隐可以看到远处的城镇。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": "sad"
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:51",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "小心翼翼地查看庭院中是否有人在，但是并没有看到人影。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": "sad"
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:52",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "美亚",
      "text": "「我……到底是怎么了？」",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": "sad"
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:81",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "望向房间的门。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": "sad"
    },
    {
      "id": "s102.txt:start:82",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "",
      "text": "就算继续留在这里，也无法更好地理解现在的状况。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": "sad"
    },
    {
      "id": "excerpt-complete",
      "type": "text",
      "speaker": "本版说明",
      "text": "本版序章节选到此结束。部分原作段落尚未接入。可在标题的「框架演示」中体验选项、自动播放及存读档功能。",
      "background": "room",
      "portrait": ""
    }
  ],
